subsectors),\\n    BasisSectors[b1] \[LongDash] basis sectors (at least one \
immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[b1] \[LongDash] a rule to \
nullify all zero j[b1\[Ellipsis]],\\n    CutDs[b1] \[LongDash] a flag list of \
